   "t": 62.29,
   "kind": "thought",
   "data": {
    "text": "In `lagos-lekki-v2` for a `120 mm / 3 h` storm over the whole study area.\n\nDefaults left: `pattern`, `sim_hours`, `output_interval_min`.\nNo gauged river inflows in this area.\nTide not changed.\n\n### 1. Baseline\n\nRun `r_e02ffbbbe8c27b2d` - preset `baseline 120mm/3h` verbatim:\n\n* whole area: `buildings_flooded` 29137, `road_km_impassable` 384.7, `max_depth_m` 2.051, `passability_threshold_m` 0.3\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:road_km_impassable` 34.912\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:max_depth_m` 1.142\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:flooded_area_km2` 0.7805\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:buildings_flooded` 731\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:people_exposed` 3840\n\nExpressway is extensively impassable at baseline. Passable here means `road_km_impassable` = 0 at 0.3 m threshold.\n\nScreened with `surrogate_sweep` for `objective road_km_impassable`. Screening only - not cited. Confirmed candidates below with solver.\n\n### 2. Test one change at a time\n\n**A - 1 intervention: city-wide new drainage 40 mm/h**\n\n`r_0e76871a05c16a80` : `drain_upgrade add_mm_h 40` with no `place`\n= city-wide new drainage, not a local fix.\n\n* whole area: `buildings_flooded` 10107, `road_km_impassable` 15.164\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:road_km_impassable` 1.091\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:max_depth_m` 0.405\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:flooded_area_km2` 0.1274\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:buildings_flooded` 231\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:people_exposed` 615\n\n97% reduction on Expressway vs baseline 34.912 -> 1.091 km, but still >0, max 0.405 m > 0.3 m threshold. Not passable.\n\n**B - 1 intervention: city-wide upgraded existing drains x3.0 + city-wide new drainage 40 mm/h**\n\n`r_f01533333fbe4c0c` : `drain_upgrade capacity_factor 3.0 + add_mm_h 40.0` with no `place`\n\n* whole area: `buildings_flooded` 9746, `road_km_impassable` 14.015\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:road_km_impassable` 0.617\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:max_depth_m` 0.405\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:flooded_area_km2` 0.0821\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:buildings_flooded` 180\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:people_exposed` 412\n\nBetter than A, but still 0.617 km impassable. Not passable.\n\n**C - 2 interventions: B + green in Lekki Phase 1**\n\n`r_652e3f416e2b260c` :\n`drain_upgrade capacity_factor 3.0 + add_mm_h 40.0` + `green place Lekki Phase 1 infiltration_mm_h 40 manning 0.08`\n\n* whole area: `buildings_flooded` 9112, `road_km_impassable` 13.159\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:road_km_impassable` 0.617\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:max_depth_m` 0.405\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:flooded_area_km2` 0.0764\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:buildings_flooded` 176\n* `area:Lekki-Epe Expressway:people_exposed` 382\n\nNo further reduction on Expressway impassable length vs B.\n\n### 3. Finding\n\nNo tested set keeps `Lekki-Epe Expressway` fully passable at 0.3 m in this storm:\n\n* baseline 34.912 km\n* A city-wide 40 mm/h new drainage: 1.091 km\n* B city-wide x3 + 40 mm/h new: 0.617 km\n* C B + green Lekki Phase 1: 0.617 km\n\nSmallest set reaching the minimum found, 0.617 km, is B - a single `drain_upgrade` object combining `capacity_factor 3.0` on existing drains plus `add_mm_h 40.0` city-wide new drainage, run `r_f01533333fbe4c0c`.\n\nTo reach 0.0 km will need stronger / additional measures beyond the 4-run budget used here, e.g. higher city-wide `add_mm_h`, targeted drainage on the Expressway corridor itself, and/or pond storage on open land e.g. `Open land near Ajah / Osapa / Agungi / Ikate` - to be tested in a follow-up session.\n"
